# 统一换行符为 LF —— 这个仓库里有 shell 脚本，CRLF 会让 bash 报奇怪的语法错误。
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh   text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.txt  text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.svg  text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

# 二进制：不要做任何换行转换
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.mp4  binary
*.mov  binary
*.zip  binary
*.gz   binary
*.pdf  binary

# 让 GitHub 语言统计正确：把工程文档当作文档，而不是代码
docs/**/*.md linguist-documentation
CHANGELOG.md linguist-documentation
README.md    linguist-documentation
README.en.md linguist-documentation
CONTRIBUTING.md linguist-documentation
LICENSE      linguist-documentation
assets/viewer.html linguist-vendored=false
